{"name":"Pesto","hex":"#c1b23e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pesto","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sauce, especially for pasta, originating from the Genoa region in Italy, made from basil, garlic, pine nuts, olive oil and cheese (usually pecorino)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pesto"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pesto","blocks":[{"text":"Pesto, also known as pesto genovese, is an Italian paste traditionally made with leaves of Genovese basil, extra virgin olive oil, Parmesan, pecorino sardo, pine nuts, and garlic. It originated in the Ligurian city of Genoa and is used to dress pasta."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/BasilPesto.JPG/330px-BasilPesto.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pesto","wikidata":"Q9896"},{"title":"Pesto (penguin)","blocks":[{"text":"Pesto is a king penguin living at Sea Life Melbourne Aquarium who gained notability in September 2024 due to his exceptionally large size during his infancy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Pesto_%28penguin%29_%28cropped%29.png/330px-Pesto_%28penguin%29_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pesto_(penguin)","wikidata":"Q130374399"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/BasilkumPesto.jpg/500px-BasilkumPesto.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/BasilkumPesto.jpg/500px-BasilkumPesto.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pesto","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABasilkumPesto.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/PastaWithPesto.JPG/500px-PastaWithPesto.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=par